    {
      "text": "四名快递员在怪物统治的反乌托邦中合作运送包裹",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "A 4-player co-op horror comedy where you drop in as couriers delivering packages in a dystopian world ruled by grotesque monsters.",
