      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "拥有99具备用克隆体，死亡自动替换，耗尽后重置但保留已购物品",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Throughout your employment, you get 99 backup clones. With every death, a fresh clone is deployed to continue your hard work. Run out of “lives”? Everything resets - like nothing ever happened. But you keep your purchased swag!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2887450/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "配送路线覆盖鬼屋、恐慌工厂与南极基地，各自带来新挑战",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Haunted houses, panic factories and the Antarctic base bring new sights, new challenges, and new ways to perish - oops! I mean, grow.",
